/ Inside plang's own goals no event runs while event.setting.goal is app (the default): reading %!error% a thousand
/ times shows plang's error goal each time, and "before each goal" still runs Count once, for Loop alone. With
/ event.setting.goal all, it runs for each of them too.
Start
- set %count% = 0
- before each goal, call Count
- call Loop
- assert %count% equals 1, "under app, plang's own goals run no events"

/ Reads %!error% a thousand times.
Loop
- foreach %!range.1.1000%, call Read

/ One read of %!error%.
Read
- set %seen% = %!error%

/ The event's call.
Count
- set %count% = %count% + 1
